{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10103120","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10103120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1010312001:1":{"text":"弗朗茨果然在和盗匪勾结……阻挠我们接近真相！","source_cn":"弗朗茨果然在和盗匪勾结……阻挠我们接近真相！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFFA4503F24252A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1010312002:1":{"text":"忙活了一大圈，总算是有些收获。","source_cn":"忙活了一大圈，总算是有些收获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC2D48B22AD2DD3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010312003:1":{"text":"大家想的都一样吧？结论已经很明确了，这场火灾与魔法师无关。","source_cn":"大家想的都一样吧？结论已经很明确了，这场火灾与魔法师无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC7F2F3FCE2FDA0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010312004:1":{"text":"事发时，村子里虽然出现了火元素，但火元素并非引发火灾的源头，在那之前已经有人点燃了火把。","source_cn":"事发时，村子里虽然出现了火元素，但火元素并非引发火灾的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D3700360969DBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010312005:1":{"text":"而真正的凶手，是我们在南村见过的那群人——弗朗茨的手下。","source_cn":"而真正的凶手，是我们在南村见过的那群人——弗朗茨的手下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60E9B32DC07BCBE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","do